#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:140
#: becbdfa822ff47a49599145d763c24be
msgid "Loading firmware onto Boards with external flash"
msgstr "将固件烧录到具有外部闪存的飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:142
#: 33fae326d667494b86442bbdc18fdeaf
msgid ""
"Some recent boards, most notably those from Seriously Pro Racing "
"(http://www.seriouslypro.com/), use MCUs with small amounts of internal "
"flash but with much larger externally connected flash chips. These boards "
"require extra steps to load ArduPilot firmware. Typically some kind of "
"bootloader resides on the internal flash and then the main firmware resides "
"on the external flash."
msgstr ""
"部分新型飞控板，尤其是来自 Seriously Pro "
"Racing（http://www.seriouslypro.com/）的飞控板，使用内部闪存较少但连接了更大外部闪存芯片的 "
"MCU。这些飞控板需要额外步骤来烧录 ArduPilot 固件。通常，某种引导程序存储在内部闪存中，而主固件存储在外部闪存中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:145
#: e2a8d107ee1d4d66afa99f15e33e47b1
msgid "Loading firmware using SSBL"
msgstr "使用 SSBL 烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:147
#: 2ee59026d5d64c0a948deb1f3da99287
msgid ""
"The SPRacing series of boards come pre-installed with a proprietary "
"bootloader on the internal flash and require the use of a second stage "
"bootloader to load further firmware. There are a couple of options to load "
"firmware with these boards, but whichever option you choose you will need to"
" initially load ArduPilot using SSBL. Please follow the \"INSTALLATION\" "
"instructions at https://github.com/spracing/ssbl in order to load SSBL onto "
"your board. Once SSBL is loaded please follow the PX4 instructions to load "
"ArduPilot onto the board https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#px4-installation-"
"to-external-flash but instead of using PX4 firmware please use the "
"arducopter.bin firmware image. A summary of the steps follows:"
msgstr ""
"SPRacing "
"系列飞控板出厂预装了内部闪存上的专有引导程序，需要使用第二阶段引导程序来烧录其他固件。有几种方法可以在这些飞控板上烧录固件，但无论选择哪种方式，都需要先通过"
" SSBL 烧录 ArduPilot。请按照 https://github.com/spracing/ssbl 的 「INSTALLATION」 说明将"
" SSBL 烧录到飞控板。SSBL 烧录完成后，请按照 PX4 说明将 ArduPilot 烧录到飞控板 "
"https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#px4-installation-to-external-flash，但使用 "
"arducopter.bin 固件镜像代替 PX4 固件。步骤摘要如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:149
#: 7fb7049639bd407d91160e6e5ee9cbd7
msgid ""
"Download https://github.com/spracing/ssbl/releases and install SSBL to "
"external flash following https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#installation-to-"
"external-flash"
msgstr ""
"下载 https://github.com/spracing/ssbl/releases 并按照 "
"https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#installation-to-external-flash 将 SSBL "
"安装到外部闪存"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:150
#: f6e743015afa4d87ac3a0da1424a5a5a
msgid ""
"Download the latest ArduPilot external flash binary, for instance "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/SPRacingH7/arducopter.bin"
msgstr ""
"下载最新的 ArduPilot 外部闪存二进制文件，例如 "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/SPRacingH7/arducopter.bin"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:151
#: d06d648955ba450593ef952d69816ddf
msgid "Use dd to pad the binary to 2MB:"
msgstr "使用 dd 将二进制文件填充到 2MB："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:158
#: 96a046e40d9e433ebfd1633950fd3733
msgid ""
"Put the board into SSBL dfu mode - power off, hold BIND (not BOOT), power on"
" - LED flashes fast, release BIND, LED flashed slow - DFU mode enabled"
msgstr ""
"将飞控板置于 SSBL dfu 模式——断电，按住 BIND（不是 BOOT），上电——LED 快速闪烁，释放 BIND，LED 慢速闪烁——DFU "
"模式已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:159
#: 3d5c3f7d00ef43e68146119bf129f183
msgid "Flash the binary using"
msgstr "使用以下命令烧录二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:165
#: 40fb3ba53312445389e567c636719814
msgid ""
"Verify the flash. The dfu-util command below copies the contents of the "
"flash back to the computer, the diff command will tell you if the contents "
"are identical or different. Do not attempt to fly if diff doesn't say the "
"files are identical - retry."
msgstr ""
"验证烧录结果。下面的 dfu-util 命令将闪存内容复制回电脑，diff 命令会告知内容是否相同。如果 diff "
"不显示文件相同，请勿尝试飞行——重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:172
#: c3b5c27ce92e43b0acef858495ce6ff2
msgid ""
"Power off, install an SD card (.note: you *must* install an SD card, the "
"firmware will not boot without it), power on"
msgstr "断电，安装 SD 卡（注意：*必须*安装 SD 卡，否则固件无法启动），上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:173
#: 5d6fd7a5671a4d588403b7019b366540
msgid "Configure the board as normal using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 按正常方式配置飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:175
#: 6a3006535cf84e68a33b165a8b916a5c
msgid ""
"At this point you should have working firmware on the board. If you want to "
"load new firmware you will need to follow steps 2-7 again (you cannot use "
"Mission Planner to load firmware). If you are certain that you will never "
"want to load betaflight on the board then you can install the ArduPilot "
"bootloader."
msgstr ""
"此时飞控板上应有可用的固件。如果要烧录新固件，需要重复步骤 2-7（不能使用 Mission Planner 烧录固件）。如果确定不再需要在飞控板上烧录"
" Betaflight，可以安装 ArduPilot 引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:178
#: 1420f0ad93254fcf88c6793a2ae9b3cd
msgid "Installing the ArduPilot bootloader"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot 引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:180
#: 9c6033c547ad44809e43a4cc7cf67d95
msgid ""
"installing the ArduPilot bootloader is a one-way operation. You cannot "
"restore the board to factory configuration or load betaflight after this "
"step - you would have to return the board to Seriously Pro to be re-flashed "
"with factory firmware, assuming that is possible"
msgstr ""
"安装 ArduPilot 引导程序是不可逆操作。此步骤后无法将飞控板恢复到出厂配置或烧录 Betaflight——您必须将飞控板退回给 "
"Seriously Pro 以重新刷写出厂固件（如果可能的话）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:182
#: 24b4910ebad54206aca993b2ec2e60fc
msgid ""
"**If you are certain that you only want to use ArduPilot on the board**, "
"then flashing the ardupilot bootloader enables much simpler subsequent "
"upgrades."
msgstr "**如果确定只想在飞控板上使用 ArduPilot**，那么烧录 ArduPilot 引导程序可以使后续升级更加简单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:184
#: efe80512e63a4add8097d1719d5e0efb
msgid ""
"You must initially have a working version of ArduPilot installed on the "
"board - follow the steps above."
msgstr "必须先在飞控板上安装可用的 ArduPilot 版本——按上述步骤操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:185
#: f2908ad7dfac46a28ea3ea1c227c1077
msgid ""
"You now must remove the copy protection on the internal flash. This is a "
"destructive operation requiring complete erasure of the flash. ArduPilot "
"provides support to make this easy. Set :ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = "
"16."
msgstr ""
"现在必须解除内部闪存的写保护。这是一个破坏性操作，需要完全擦除闪存。ArduPilot 提供支持使此操作更简便。设置 "
":ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 16。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:186
#: 8bb3504637f64673b01850069b969cc6
msgid ""
"Power off and power on the board. The board will not appear to boot but the "
"flash sector is being erased. Wait a few seconds and then power off the "
"board."
msgstr "断电并重新上电。飞控板看起来不会启动，但闪存扇区正在被擦除。等待几秒钟，然后断电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:187
#: 753f843548d748a4b453a4f82b3dac94
msgid ""
"Hold down the ``boot`` button (boot *not* bind this time) and power on the "
"autopilot. This will put the board in dfu mode."
msgstr "按住 ``boot`` 按钮（这次是 boot *而非* bind），然后给飞控板上电。这将使飞控板进入 dfu 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:188
#: 172ff60b60694063b163b4cfc2d568ad
msgid ""
"Download the ArduPilot bootloader, e.g. "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/SPRacingH7_bl.bin"
msgstr ""
"下载 ArduPilot 引导程序，例如 "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/SPRacingH7_bl.bin"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:189
#: d7c47355c38d4d91ad413365a3a65d94
msgid "Install the bootloader via dfu:"
msgstr "通过 dfu 安装引导程序："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:195
#: 01ad430fca89413aad4cbd445d45e92c
msgid "Reboot the board."
msgstr "重启飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:196
#: cc937451dfc247d19a2d6eca571054c5
msgid "You can now use your favorite tool to upload the ArduPilot firmware"
msgstr "现在可以使用您喜欢的工具上传 ArduPilot 固件"
